			// as
			// well: the legacy path forwards a pre-existing value even when the remote query also projects that name.
			// The
			// marker is excluded only when it is the generated projection declaration; an endpoint, body expression, or
			// projection source that reads it is a real dependency.
			result.addAll(serviceVars);
